### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 03: Validation & Error Handling HTTP Requests
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### 1. Create Product - Valid Request (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-1001",
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Premium wireless mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches",
  "price": 149.99,
  "stockQuantity": 35,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Create Product - Validation Failure: Blank Name, Invalid SKU, Negative Price (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "invalid-sku-format",
  "name": "",
  "description": "Faulty product payload",
  "price": -10.00,
  "stockQuantity": -5,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 3. Create Product - Duplicate SKU Conflict (409 Conflict)
# Run this twice with the same SKU to trigger 409 Conflict ProblemDetail
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-1001",
  "name": "Another Keyboard",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 4. Get Product By ID - Not Found (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/999999

### 5. Create Product - Malformed JSON Body (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-ELC-2002",
  "name": "Unterminated JSON",
  "price": 
